---
layout: model.njk
isHome: true
title: "AI makes people faster. Is it making your organisation faster?"
description: "The context work depends on, how work flows, how teams are shaped and how leaders see: four layers of an AI-native organisation, from someone redesigning them from the inside."
video:
  title: "The model in two minutes"
  length: "2:00"
  youtube: null
---

<section class="m-sec">
  <div class="m-hero">
    <div class="m-hero-copy">
      <span class="m-eyebrow">AI transformation, from the inside</span>
      <h1>AI makes people faster. Is it making your organisation faster?</h1>
      <p class="m-lede">AI accelerates individual tasks, but better tools alone don’t make organisations more productive. The gains come from redesigning the system around the tools: what people know, how work moves, how teams are organised and how decisions get made.</p>
      <p class="m-lede">This site is what I’ve learned redesigning all four from the inside.</p>
      <a class="m-byline" href="/about/">
        <img src="/assets/sanchit-portrait.jpg" alt="" width="40" height="40">
        <span><b>Sanchit Korgaonkar</b> · seventeen years making large programs land, at Mastercard and in B2B SaaS · <span class="m-byline-link">About me →</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="m-iso-wrap">
      <div class="m-iso" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="m-plane p-context" style="--i:0" data-layer="context" data-href="/context-layer/"></div>
        <div class="m-plane p-workflow" style="--i:1" data-layer="workflow" data-href="/workflow/"><div class="track"><i class="g-ai"></i><i class="g-ai"></i><i class="g-human"></i><i class="g-ai"></i><i class="g-human"></i><i class="g-ai"></i><i class="g-human"></i></div></div>
        <div class="m-plane p-org" style="--i:2" data-layer="org" data-href="/org-design/"><div class="grid">{% for n in range(9) %}<i></i>{% endfor %}</div></div>
        <div class="m-plane p-gov" style="--i:3" data-layer="governance" data-href="/governance/"><div class="bars"><i class="ai" style="width:88%"></i><i style="width:62%"></i><i class="ai" style="width:74%"></i><i style="width:46%"></i><i class="ai" style="width:80%"></i></div></div>
      </div>
      <ul class="m-iso-labels">
        {% for l in layers | reverse %}<li><a href="/{{ l.slug }}/" data-layer="{{ l.key }}"><b><span class="m-num">{{ l.n }}</span>{{ l.name }}</b><span>{{ l.sub }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="m-sec">
  <div class="m-col">
    {% set v = video %}{% set size = "" %}{% include "partials/video.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="m-sec">
  <h2>What changes when building gets cheap</h2>
  <div class="m-shifts">
    <div class="m-shift m-shift-head" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span class="from">Before</span><span></span><span class="to">Now</span></div>
    {% for l in layers %}
    <a class="m-shift" href="/{{ l.slug }}/"><span class="ly"><span class="m-num">{{ l.n }}</span>{{ l.name }}</span><span class="from"><span class="lbl">Before: </span>{{ l.shift[0] }}</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="to"><span class="lbl">Now: </span>{{ l.shift[1] }}</span></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>


<section class="m-sec">
  <h2>Four things that surprised me</h2>
  <div class="m-insights">
    {% for l in layers %}
    <a class="m-insight" href="/{{ l.slug }}/">
      <span class="m-insight-ly"><span class="m-num">{{ l.n }}</span>{{ l.name }}</span>
      <h3>{{ l.insight[0] }}</h3>
      <p>{{ l.insight[1] }}</p>
      <p class="m-sofar"><span>So far</span>{{ l.result[1] }}</p>
      <span class="m-link">Read how it went →</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="m-sec">
  <h2>Keep exploring</h2>
  <div class="m-next">
